1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,270
At a hundred degrees, pure water has pH six point one four.

2
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:06,223
Is boiling water acidic?

3
00:00:06,223 --> 00:00:06,953
No!

4
00:00:06,953 --> 00:00:12,500
It is still neutral, because hydrogen and hydroxide ions are still equal.

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,872
Neutral means equal, not pH seven.

6
00:00:15,872 --> 00:00:19,895
Seven is only the neutral point at twenty five degrees.

